[50.183616, "o", "Checking if all Task sheet samples exist in Data sheet:\r\n  NCIH1568_LUNG_TenPx15: Found at column D\r\n  IPC298_SKIN_TenPx08: Found at column E\r\n  WM2664_SKIN_TenPx02: Found at column F\r\n  SNU1_STOMACH_TenPx20: Found at column G\r\n  TE6_OESOPHAGUS_TenPx17: Found at column H\r\n  FUOV1_OVARY_TenPx16: Found at column I\r\n  LS513_LARGE_INTESTINE_TenPx09: Found at column J\r\n  THP1_HAEMATOPOIETIC_AND_LYMPHOID_TISSUE_TenPx24: Found at column K\r\n  SW48_LARGE_INTESTINE_TenPx07: Found at column L\r\n  NCIN87_STOMACH_TenPx26: Found at column M\r\n\r\nVerifying all 10 proteins are in rows 2-11 of Data sheet:\r\n"]
[50.183672, "o", "  Task row 11: sp|Q9HCY8|S10AE_HUMAN == Data row 2: sp|Q9HCY8|S10AE_HUMAN -> True\r\n  Task row 12: sp|Q96EN8|MOCOS_HUMAN == Data row 3: sp|Q96EN8|MOCOS_HUMAN -> True\r\n  Task row 13: sp|Q86UT8|CCD84_HUMAN == Data row 4: sp|Q86UT8|CCD84_HUMAN -> True\r\n  Task row 14: sp|O96000|NDUBA_HUMAN == Data row 5: sp|O96000|NDUBA_HUMAN -> True\r\n  Task row 15: sp|Q86Y38|XYLT1_HUMAN == Data row 6: sp|Q86Y38|XYLT1_HUMAN -> True\r\n  Task row 16: sp|Q5SZL2|CE85L_HUMAN == Data row 7: sp|Q5SZL2|CE85L_HUMAN -> True\r\n  Task row 17: sp|Q9BQA1|MEP50_HUMAN == Data row 8: sp|Q9BQA1|MEP50_HUMAN -> True\r\n  Task row 18: sp|Q9C0F1|CEP44_HUMAN == Data row 9: sp|Q9C0F1|CEP44_HUMAN -> True\r\n  Task row 19: sp|Q9UH03|SEPT3_HUMAN == Data row 10: sp|Q9UH03|SEPT3_HUMAN -> True\r\n  Task row 20: sp|P04632|CPNS1_HUMAN == Data row 11: sp|P04632|CPNS1_HUMAN -> True\r\n"]
