[79.079452, "o", "Verifying expression data formulas calculated:\r\nC11 formula: =INDEX(Data!$A:$BA,MATCH($A11,Data!$A:$A,0),MATCH(C$10,Data!$1:$1,0))\r\n\r\n=== Statistics section (rows 24-27) ===\r\nRow 23:\r\n  A23: Statistic\r\n  B23: None\r\n  C23: None\r\n  D23: None\r\nRow 24:\r\n  A24: Control Mean:\r\n  B24: None\r\n  C24: None\r\n  D24: None\r\nRow 25:\r\n  A25: Control StdDev:\r\n  B25: None\r\n  C25: None\r\n  D25: None\r\nRow 26:\r\n  A26: Treated Mean:\r\n  B26: None\r\n  C26: None\r\n  D26: None\r\n"]
[79.079643, "o", "Row 27:\r\n  A27: Treated StdDev:\r\n  B27: None\r\n  C27: None\r\n  D27: None\r\n\r\n=== Fold change section (rows 30-42) ===\r\nRow 30:\r\n  A30: Step 3: Fold Change Analysis\r\n  B30: None\r\n  C30: None\r\n  D30: None\r\nRow 31:\r\n  A31: Protein_ID\r\n  B31: Gene_Symbol\r\n  C31: Fold Change\r\n  D31: Log2 FC\r\nRow 32:\r\n  A32: None\r\n  B32: None\r\n  C32: None\r\n  D32: None\r\nRow 33:\r\n  A33: None\r\n  B33: None\r\n"]
[79.079725, "o", "  C33: None\r\n  D33: None\r\nRow 34:\r\n  A34: None\r\n  B34: None\r\n  C34: None\r\n  D34: None\r\n"]
