[179.939333, "o", "=== FINAL VERIFICATION ===\r\n\r\n1. Expression Data (C11:L20) - 100 cells\r\n"]
[179.939527, "o", "   ✓ 100/100 cells have INDEX-MATCH formulas\r\n\r\n2. Statistics (B24:K27) - 40 cells\r\n   ✓ 40/40 cells have statistics formulas\r\n\r\n3. Fold Change Analysis (rows 32-41)\r\n"]
[179.939583, "o", "   ✓ 10/10 rows have complete fold change formulas\r\n\r\n4. Sample formulas check:\r\n"]
[179.939656, "o", "   Expression: =INDEX(Data!$A:$BA,MATCH($A15,Data!$A:$A,0),MATCH(E$10,Data!$1:$1,0))\r\n   Control Mean: =AVERAGE(C14:G14)\r\n   Treated StdDev: =STDEV.S(H14:L14)\r\n"]
[179.93971, "o", "   Log2 FC: =E26-E24\r\n   Fold Change: =2^D35\r\n\r\n==================================================\r\nTASK COMPLETED SUCCESSFULLY!\r\n==================================================\r\n\r\nSummary of work:\r\n1. ✓ Populated C11:L20 with INDEX-MATCH formulas\r\n    to pull expression values from Data sheet\r\n2. ✓ Calculated statistics in B24:K27:\r\n    - Control Mean (row 24)\r\n    - Control StdDev (row 25)\r\n    - Treated Mean (row 26)\r\n    - Treated StdDev (row 27)\r\n3. ✓ Calculated fold changes in rows 32-41:\r\n    - Protein_ID (column A)\r\n    - Gene_Symbol (column B)\r\n"]
[179.93974, "o", "    - Fold Change (column C)\r\n    - Log2 FC (column D)\r\n4. ✓ Preserved all formatting and colors\r\n5. ✓ Used formulas only, no hard-coded values\r\n"]
