[205.538932, "o", "=== FINAL PRE-SUBMISSION CHECK ===\r\n\r\n1. Checking task requirements:\r\n\r\nRequirement: Fill C11:L20 with expression data\r\n   C11: =INDEX(Data!$A:$BA,MATCH($A11,Data!$A:$A,0),MATCH(C$10,Data!$1:$1,0))\r\n   L20: =INDEX(Data!$A:$BA,MATCH($A20,Data!$A:$A,0),MATCH(L$10,Data!$1:$1,0))\r\n\r\nRequirement: Calculate stats in yellow cells rows 24-27, cols B-K\r\n   Row 24 = Control Mean\r\n   B24 (protein 1): =AVERAGE(C11:G11)\r\n   Row 25 = Control StdDev\r\n   B25 (protein 1): =STDEV.S(C11:G11)\r\n   Row 26 = Treated Mean\r\n   B26 (protein 1): =AVERAGE(H11:L11)\r\n   Row 27 = Treated StdDev\r\n   B27 (protein 1): =STDEV.S(H11:L11)\r\n\r\nRequirement: Fill C and D in rows 32-41\r\n   Column C = Fold Change\r\n   Column D = Log2 FC\r\n   C32: =2^D32\r\n   D32: =B26-B24\r\n\r\n2. Verifying formula correctness:\r\n\r\nChecking row 9 groups:\r\n   C9: Control\r\n   D9: Control\r\n   E9: Control\r\n   F9: Control\r\n   G9: Control\r\n   H9: Treated\r\n   I9: Treated\r\n   J9: Treated\r\n   K9: Treated\r\n   L9: Treated\r\n\r\nControl samples should be C-G (5 samples)\r\nTreated samples should be H-L (5 samples)\r\n\r\nVerifying statistics use correct ranges:\r\n   B24 (Control Mean for protein in row 11): =AVERAGE(C11:G11)\r\n   Expected: =AVERAGE(C11:G11) ✓\r\n   B26 (Treated Mean for protein in row 11): =AVERAGE(H11:L11)\r\n   Expected: =AVERAGE(H11:L11) ✓\r\n\r\n3. Verifying fold change formulas:\r\n   D32 (Log2 FC): =B26-B24\r\n   Should be: Treated Mean - Control Mean = B26-B24\r\n   C32 (Fold Change): =2^D32\r\n   Should be: 2^(Log2 FC) = 2^D32\r\n\r\n============================================================\r\nALL CHECKS PASSED - READY FOR SUBMISSION\r\n============================================================\r\n"]
